# Package inspector: looking inside an agent folder
error-pki-bundle-unreadable = ordin couldn't read the agent's files. Check the folder is still there and unchanged, then try again.
error-pki-declaration-invalid = The agent's rules file isn't written in a form ordin understands. Ask its maker for a fixed copy.
error-pki-declaration-refused = ordin won't accept this agent's rules. Ask its maker for a fixed copy.
error-pki-declaration-too-large = The agent's rules file is too large. Ask its maker for a smaller one.
error-pki-folder-unreadable = ordin couldn't read that agent folder. Try again.
error-pki-format-unrecognised = ordin doesn't recognise this folder as an agent. Choose a different folder.
error-pki-lock-file-invalid = The agent's lock file can't be read. Ask its maker for a fixed copy.
error-pki-not-inspected = Look inside the agent folder first, then try again.
error-pki-part-not-found = That part isn't in this agent. Choose another one.
error-pki-store-failed = One of the saved rule sets couldn't be read, so it wasn't loaded. Check the saved rules.
